{{PAGENAME}} is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]]. 

Obtained by splitting a [[Block of Mirkwood]]. Seems to be around 25% chance (''small sample size''.) It is possible to get four worms from a single block. Worm quality will be the same as the block's.
Quality seems to be uncapped by the axe or survival skill, making this excellent curiosity for freshly spawned players.

Can also occasionally be found in [[Old Stump|old tree stump]]s. (''same quality as old stump - assumed''.)

